@startuml SD-06 Register Asset
title SD-06 Register Asset

actor "Registration Staff" as Staff
participant "Asset Registration Page" as Page
participant "Asset API" as API
participant "Asset Registration Service" as Service
database "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS

Staff -> Page: Enter asset name and assigned room
Staff -> Page: Submit registration form
Page -> API: POST /assets/register
API -> Service: register_asset()
Service -> DB: Check tag is not active
Service -> DB: Create asset\nflow_status = pending_placement
DB --> Service: Commit success
Service --> API: Registered asset
API -> WS: Broadcast asset_registered
API --> Page: Success response
WS -> Page: Update asset table

@enduml